<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Jan-April state budget deficit CZK 11.98 bln.</title>
<headline>Czech Jan-April state budget deficit CZK 11.98 bln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech state budget stood at a deficit of 11.98 billion crowns for the first four months of the year, after recording an 8.5 billion crown shortfall for the first quarter of 1997, the Finance Ministry said on Friday.</p>
</text>
